    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player, chess game, 3D, turn based, strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on historical records of the Korean War, authentically restore war scenes, campaign units, equipment systems, and AI strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will command the Chinese army and complete over 60 battles from October 24, 1950 to August 13, 1953.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the actual geographical data at the time of the war, realistically restore 3D combat scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on historical data, accurately restore the units, troop numbers, and equipment quantities of both sides in the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on historical data, there are about 20 types and over 140 pieces of weapons and equipment configured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI will take different response actions based on the player's different tactical strategies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player, chess game, 3D, turn based, strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on historical records of the Korean War, authentically restore war scenes, campaign units, equipment systems, and AI strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will command the Chinese army and complete over 60 battles from October 24, 1950 to August 13, 1953.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the actual geographical data at the time of the war, realistically restore 3D combat scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on historical data, accurately restore the units, troop numbers, and equipment quantities of both sides in the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on historical data, there are about 20 types and over 140 pieces of weapons and equipment configured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI will take different response actions based on the player's different tactical strategies.</p>",
